    "policy": "Labels are evaluation-only. case_without_labels() and to_trace_record() exclude every annotation field; labels are exposed only via case_labels()/BenchmarkCase for scoring.",
    "known_data_quirks": [
      "One Magentic-One case (08cae58d-4084-4616-b6dd-dd6534e4825b) stores root_cause.failure_id as the string \"1\" while failures[].failure_id is the integer 1; the adapter matches by str() and preserves the raw value.",
      "274 tau assistant messages have content=null when they only carry tool_calls; the adapter allows empty assistant content and preserves the raw message.",
      "Magentic-One failure annotations contain two failed_agent/role spelling mismatches (FileSurfer vs Orchestrator, Assistant vs Orchestrator); the adapter keeps raw values and normalises agent names only for comparison.",
      "Some Magentic-One ground-truth failed_agent values use 'Websurfer' while trajectory roles use 'WebSurfer'; alignment checks are case-insensitive."
